                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z^k(X)
            generated by the closed integral subschemes of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/codimension"} codimension
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi k
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
